    "bgm": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ\r\nこんな大きなステージに立てるなんて、嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "このステージで、ファンをもっと幸せにすることができる\r\nそう考えると、期待で胸が高鳴るよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、いつもの咲耶だな\r\nあれから体調を崩すこともないし、安心したよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。私のことを大事に思ってくれる人を\r\n悲しませたくないからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……テレビの出演をキャンセルしてしまってから、\r\nちゃんと自分のことを考え直したんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。きちんと体調管理をしているし\r\n休息もしっかりとっているようで安心したよ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私が倒れては本末転倒だと、理解したから……\r\nプロデューサーにも心配をかけて、すまなかったね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……成長したな、咲耶",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今もあんまり緊張していないようだし\r\n俺が心配する必要はなさそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……本当に、そう見えるかい？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。私もずいぶんと信頼されたものだな\r\nこれは喜ぶべきなんだろうけどね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……実はね、プロデューサー\r\n今、私はとても緊張しているんだよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日までプロデューサーと一緒に頑張ってきた成果を\r\nこのステージで出し切らなければ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう強く思えば思うほど\r\n足が震えそうになるんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーにだけは、私の弱い部分も\r\n知っていてほしいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050110"
  },
  {
    "select": "気づいてあげられ\r\nなくて、ごめんな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶なら大丈夫だ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "もっと甘えたって\r\nいいんだぞ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050120,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いいや、謝ることではないさ",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶が完璧に見えるのはファンのために\r\n頑張っているからだってのは、ちゃんとわかっているさ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからも、咲耶が輝けるように\r\nサポートしていくからな！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。頼もしいね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶のためなら、俺はいくらでも頑張るぞ！",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nなんだか緊張が解けてきたよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（力が抜けたみたいだ\r\nこうしてステージ前に話せて本当に良かった）",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "よしっ！　観客も、アナタも……この会場にいる全員を\r\n楽しませてくるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ああ、咲耶なら、きっとできる……\r\n期待しているぞ）",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050160,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私なら、か……\r\n本当に、そう思うのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶は、今日まで頑張ってきたんだ\r\nだから、難しく考える必要なんてない",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつも通りの咲耶を、\r\nファンのみんなに披露してくれば大丈夫だ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。プロデューサーは、私に期待しているんだね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、信頼しているんだ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "！　……信頼、か",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nなんだか、少し気持ちが楽になったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、私がどんなパフォーマンスをしても\r\n受け止めてくれそうだな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタが隣にいれば、きっとどんな困難も\r\n乗り越えられるだろうね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "よしっ！　じゃあプロデューサーの信頼にこたえるためにも\r\nありのままの自分で行ってくるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050220"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶は、人の為に一生懸命になれるアイドルだ\r\nでも、ひとりで頑張りすぎないで、もっと俺に頼ってくれ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "頼る……か……\r\n自分には縁がないことだと思っていたよ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、咲耶のプロデューサーだからな\r\n何か不安を感じたら、いつでも頼ってくれていいんだ",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "甘えるのは、少し気恥ずかしいけど……\r\nアナタになら、背中を預けられる……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサーが隣にいてくれて、\r\nとても心強いよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから私も、\r\n安心してステージに立つことができるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600105/1006001050270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001050280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "見ててくれ、プロデューサー！\r\n最高のステージにしてくるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
